# Files that stay in the repo and out of the distributed package.
# Exact relative paths, one per line -- modkit matches literally, no globs.

# All three suites. Each one needs the engine's checkout to run at all: the
# two drivers require engine modules (src.render.Pipelines, PaletteFX,
# tests/drivers/util.lua), and the pure-logic suite measures its anchors
# against data/generated/maps.lua -- deliberately, so the numbers are the
# game's own. A shipped test that requires an engine module reads as a
# private require against the archive, and `pack` treats warnings as fatal.
tests/fly_logic_test.lua
tests/fly_shots.lua
tests/fly_partymenu_test.lua

# The mod index entry: metadata for gen1recomp-mod-index, versioned here so
# the listing and the mod cannot drift apart. Not part of what a player
# installs.
index/meta.json
index/description.md
index/thumbnail.png

# The README's animations. Nine megabytes of marketing has no business in a
# sixty-kilobyte install -- and CONTRIBUTING-mods.md's legal posture is
# explicit that a distributed mod carries no ROM-derived bytes "not even in
# its preview images". They live in the repository, where the README reads
# them, and nowhere else.
docs/media/flight.gif
docs/media/compass.gif
docs/media/landing.gif
docs/media/fly-menu.gif
